================================================================================
Third-party assets
================================================================================

The PolyForm grant above covers the code and text written for this project.
Several bundled assets are third-party works under their own terms, which travel
with the files and are not relicensed by this file. Note that some of them are
embedded *inside* source files rather than sitting in an assets folder.

All of the licenses below permit commercial use, so they do not stand in the way
of the copyright holder selling this software later. Every one of them requires
that attribution be kept, and the CC BY-SA cues additionally require that
adaptations *of those cues* be shared alike.

ARTWORK — Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0)
    The card, boss and forge-inscription icons are by Lorc and Delapouite, from
    game-icons.net, licensed CC BY 3.0:
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

    These are NOT separate image files. The SVG path data is embedded directly
    in `src/games/scoundrel/components/SuitIcon.jsx`, so that file contains
    CC BY 3.0 third-party work regardless of the license on the code around it.
    Attribution as shipped is in the game's Credits screen. Keep it.

    One icon, `vampiric_edge`, is hand-authored for this project and is covered
    by the PolyForm grant rather than by CC BY.

MUSIC — Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0)
    The two looping tracks in `public/audio/music/` are by Kevin MacLeod
    (incompetech.com), licensed CC BY 3.0:
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

    CC BY requires ATTRIBUTION. If you redistribute this project, or reuse these
    files anywhere else, you must credit Kevin MacLeod. The attribution as
    shipped lives in `public/audio/music/CREDITS.md` and in the game's Credits
    screen; keep it, and keep it reachable by players.

    Per-track detail, including album and ISRC, is in that CREDITS.md.

SOUND EFFECTS — mixed terms
    - Combat sounds by Philippe Groarke, CC BY-SA 3.0. Share-alike: an
      adaptation of these specific sounds must be released under CC BY-SA 3.0.
      Bundling them unchanged in this larger work does not relicense the work
      around them.
    - Smithing sounds by hjm, CC BY 3.0.
    - Card sounds from Cockatrice.
    - Additional effects from Kenney and OpenGameArt, CC0 (no obligations).

    Attribution as shipped is in the game's Credits screen.

BELL CUES — public domain
    The one-shot cues are derived from public-domain bell recordings by
    `scripts/build-bell-cues.sh`, which downloads the sources and does the
    editing itself, so provenance is reproducible rather than asserted. See
    `public/audio/music/CREDITS.md`.

FONTS
    Currently loaded from Google Fonts at runtime and not redistributed here, so
    no font files in this repo carry a license. Issue 18 proposes self-hosting
    them; if that lands, the fonts arrive under the SIL Open Font License and
    their OFL text must be vendored alongside the files and noted here.

GAME DESIGN
    The original single-deck card game "Scoundrel" is by Zach Gage and Kurt
    Bieg. This project began as an implementation of it and has since diverged
    substantially (see `REWORK.md`). Game rules and mechanics are not
    copyrightable subject matter, but the debt is real and worth stating: the
    core loop here descends from their design.
